  "cli.help.full": "\n{bold}{cyan}╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}  {bold}{white}mip v{{version}}{/white}{/bold} - {gray}그냥 npm이 별로라서{/gray}                      {bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}  {gray}플러그인, 보안 등!{/gray}                                           {bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝{/cyan}{/bold}\n\n{bold}{white}주요 명령어:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip init{/cyan}                              {gray}새 프로젝트 생성{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip install{/cyan} {gray}[패키지]{/gray}                  {gray}패키지 설치{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip install -s{/cyan} {gray}[패키지]{/gray}               {gray}초고속 설치{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip uninstall{/cyan} {gray}<패키지>{/gray}                {gray}패키지 제거{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip update{/cyan}                            {gray}모든 패키지 업데이트{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip list{/cyan}                              {gray}설치된 패키지 목록{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}정보:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip search{/cyan} {gray}<쿼리>{/gray}                    {gray}npm 레지스트리 검색{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip info{/cyan} {gray}<패키지>{/gray}                    {gray}패키지 상세 정보{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip outdated{/cyan}                           {gray}오래된 패키지 목록{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip why{/cyan} {gray}<패키지>{/gray}                     {gray}이 패키지가 설치된 이유{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}보안:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip audit{/cyan}                             {gray}취약점 확인{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip doctor{/cyan}                            {gray}시스템 진단{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}개발:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip create{/cyan} {gray}<템플릿> <이름>{/gray}            {gray}템플릿에서 생성{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip run{/cyan} {gray}<스크립트>{/gray}                   {gray}npm 스크립트 실행{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip exec{/cyan} {gray}<명령어>{/gray}                    {gray}로컬 바이너리 실행{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip link{/cyan}                              {gray}로컬 패키지 연결{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}별칭:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip alias set{/cyan} {gray}<이름> <명령어>{/gray}         {gray}별칭 생성{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias remove{/cyan} {gray}<이름>{/gray}              {gray}별칭 제거{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias list{/cyan}                          {gray}모든 별칭 표시{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias clear{/cyan}                         {gray}모든 별칭 삭제{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}모노레포:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip workspaces list{/cyan}                   {gray}Workspace 목록{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip workspaces run{/cyan} {gray}<스크립트>{/gray}         {gray}모든 Workspace에서 스크립트 실행{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}유지보수:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip cache clean{/cyan}                       {gray}캐시 정리{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip cache size{/cyan}                        {gray}캐시 크기 표시{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip ci{/cyan}                                {gray}CI 설치{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}예제:{/white}{/bold}\n  {gray}mip install -s express{/gray}                {gray}초고속 설치{/gray}\n  {gray}mip install lodash --save-dev{/gray}\n  {gray}mip create react my-app{/gray}\n  {gray}mip why lodash{/gray}\n  {gray}mip cache clean{/gray}\n  {gray}mip doctor{/gray}\n  {gray}mip alias set i install{/gray}               {gray}install의 별칭{/gray}\n  {gray}mip i express{/gray}                         {gray}별칭 사용{/gray}\n\n{bold}{yellow}초고속 모드 기능:{/yellow}{/bold}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}병렬 다운로드{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}스트림 추출{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}스마트 캐싱{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}초고속 재설치{/gray}\n  ",

